---
# Stopgap on dev only (T-5179, 2026-10-22): the gateway was OOMKilled 14 times at its 1Gi limit
# (development-values) between 03:50Z and 05:10Z under the HFP upsertBatch stream plus anonymous
# read bursts; prod's 1Gi pod OOMs on the same pattern (later/T-later-prod-gateway-oom-1gi). The
# request stays 384Mi. smartcity reuses dev's values profile, so this sits in dev's environment and
# goes away when the code bounds what one burst holds.
context-gateway:
  gateway:
    rawValues:
      resources:
        limits:
          memory: 1536Mi
